cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: >-
  Analysis code for: Alveolar-capillary cell composition and diffusing capacity
  unexplained by airflow limitation and emphysema in COPD lung tissue
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived results for a study of diffusing capacity (DLCO) that is
  not explained by airflow limitation and CT emphysema in COPD lung tissue, using the
  public microarray dataset GSE47460 and the single-cell reference GSE136831.
authors:
